      "value": "@{67e713a2970cc5e816ddbbba|full_name} On Windows you can find it in appdata, it's a folder on your computer, in there you can find the Local Low folder, and then inside of the Local Low folder you will be able to find the VRChat one. If you're having the same bug, delete the Vrchat folder in Local Low, then uninstall VRChat from Steam, and re-install VRChat, it should clear up the issue.",
